#NEXUS

[ galton2007a_fig3: Basal sauropodomorph tree (Galton & Upchurch 2004), slanted. Internal labels are the letters printed at nodes, as printed: s (Sauropodomorpha), p (Prosauropoda), sa (Sauropoda); the node numbers 1-10 are not encoded. Read by eye at 3x. 24 tips, fully resolved; 3 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=24;
    TAXLABELS
        Ancestor
        Blikanasaurus
        Kotasaurus
        Vulcanodon
        Barapasaurus
        Shunosaurus
        Thecodontosaurus
        Saturnalia
        Ammosaurus
        Anchisaurus
        Riojasaurus
        Melanorosaurus
        Camelotia
        Lessemsaurus
        Jingshanosaurus
        Yunnanosaurus
        Massospondylus
        Mussaurus
        Coloradisaurus
        '"G." sinensis'
        Lufengosaurus
        Euskelosaurus
        Plateosaurus
        Sellosaurus
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE galton2007a_fig3 = [&R] (Ancestor,((Blikanasaurus,(Kotasaurus,(Vulcanodon,(Barapasaurus,Shunosaurus))))sa,(Thecodontosaurus,(Saturnalia,(((Ammosaurus,Anchisaurus),(Riojasaurus,(Melanorosaurus,(Camelotia,Lessemsaurus)))),(Jingshanosaurus,(Yunnanosaurus,(Massospondylus,(Mussaurus,(Coloradisaurus,(('"G." sinensis',Lufengosaurus),(Euskelosaurus,(Plateosaurus,Sellosaurus)))))))))))p)s);
END;
